<package name="lumine-capture" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>LumineCapture: Fast, lightweight Wayland screenshot tool</title>
  <description>LumineCapture is a fast, lightweight screenshot tool for Wayland. It starts quickly without a background daemon and opens captures in a GUI editor.

It captures the whole workspace, a monitor, a region or a window (KDE Plasma only for now). The editor has basic annotations, blur, pixelation and a color picker. Screenshots can be copied, saved or pinned on screen.

Built-in offline OCR (PaddleOCR) lets you select and copy text straight from a screenshot. Models are downloaded from the GUI.

Works on most Wayland compositors, including KDE Plasma, COSMIC, niri and Hyprland. GNOME is not supported yet.</description>
</package>
